---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
import { getLocalizedPath } from '../../i18n/routes';

const formulaRoute = getLocalizedPath('/percentage-formula', 'en');
const mainRoute = getLocalizedPath('/', 'en');
---

<LegalLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Contact"
  description="How to reach the team behind prozentrechner-online.com: questions, bug reports and suggestions by email."
  canonicalUrl="https://prozentrechner-online.com/en/contact"
  alternateUrls={{
    de: 'https://prozentrechner-online.com/kontakt',
    en: 'https://prozentrechner-online.com/en/contact',
  }}
  breadcrumb="Contact"
>
  <p>
    Found a bug, have a question, or an idea for another calculator? We are glad to hear from you.
    Email is the quickest way to reach us.
  </p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="font-semibold">{site.email}</a>
  </p>
  <p>
    For bug reports, please include the page concerned, the values you entered and the result you
    expected where possible. That helps us reproduce and fix the problem faster.
  </p>

  <h2>Response time</h2>
  <p>
    We read every message and usually reply within a few working days. As the site is run as a
    private project, it may occasionally take a little longer.
  </p>

  <h2>What we can help with – and what we can’t</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Happy to help with:</strong> questions about the calculators, reports of calculation
      or display errors, suggestions for new features, accessibility feedback.</li>
    <li><strong>Not possible:</strong> individual legal, tax or financial advice, or binding review
      of specific contracts, tax cases or salary negotiations. Please consult a qualified
      professional for those.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>The answer may already be here</h2>
  <p>
    Many percentage questions – such as the VAT trap, the rule of three, or the difference between
    percentage change and percentage difference – are already explained in detail. It is worth a
    look:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href={`${mainRoute}#faq`}>Frequently asked questions about percentages</a></li>
    <li><a href={formulaRoute}>All formulas with worked steps and examples</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    If you email us, we process your details solely to handle your request. For more information,
    see our <a href={getLocalizedPath('/privacy-policy', 'en')}>privacy policy</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
